<article id="post-4491" class="post-4491 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-cse-issuer-stories category-cse-quarterly tag-cse-issuer-stories tag-cse-quarterly tag-igen tag-igen-networks">
	
	<a class="post-thumbnail" href="https://blog.thecse.com/igen-networks-takes-relationship-car-driver-whole-new-level/" aria-hidden="true">
	<img width="672" height="372" src="https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/09/iGEN-Logo_revised-672x372.png" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="IGEN Networks takes relationship between car and driver to a whole new level" decoding="async" loading="lazy" data-attachment-id="4515" data-permalink="https://blog.thecse.com/igen-networks-takes-relationship-car-driver-whole-new-level/igen-logo_revised/" data-orig-file="https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/09/iGEN-Logo_revised.png" data-orig-size="772,515" data-comments-opened="0" data-image-title="iGEN Logo_revised" data-image-description="" data-image-caption="" data-large-file="https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/09/iGEN-Logo_revised.png" />	</a>

	
	<header class="entry-header">
				<div class="entry-meta">
			<span class="cat-links"><a href="https://blog.thecse.com/category/cse-issuer-stories/" rel="category tag">CSE Issuer Stories</a>, <a href="https://blog.thecse.com/category/cse-quarterly/" rel="category tag">CSE Quarterly</a></span>
